Recording a Payment — The manager records Nyasha’s $600 cash payment

9
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:48,424
Balance Cleared — Nyasha Mapfumo is now paid up — every payment gets a receipt number and an audit-log entry

10
00:00:48,574 --> 00:00:52,539
Maintenance — The leaking-faucet ticket, assigned to maintenance staff member Farai Ncube

11
00:00:52,689 --> 00:00:59,518
Reports — Collected, outstanding, expenses and net income for each property — exportable to Excel or PDF

12
00:00:59,668 --> 00:01:04,464
