17
00:01:26,786 --> 00:01:32,448
Tenant Portal in Shona — Chipo Mutasa: “Mauya” (welcome), her unit as “Avondale Heights · Yuniti 101”, and her balance

18
00:01:32,598 --> 00:01:37,615
Bhadhara Rendi — Pay Rent — Tenants can pay online; offline, the app uses a simulated checkout so everything runs without paid accounts

19
